{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"overall\": [\"C4\", \"C2\", \"C1\", \"C5\", \"C3\"],\n  \"keep\": [\"C4\", \"C2\", \"C1\", \"C5\", \"C3\"],\n  \"cover\": [\"C4\", \"C2\", \"C3\", \"C5\", \"C1\"],\n  \"lean\": [\"C5\", \"C3\", \"C2\", \"C4\", \"C1\"],\n  \"plain\": [\"C5\", \"C3\", \"C1\", \"C2\", \"C4\"],\n  \"why\": \"overall：C4最完整地把两种珍惜互相牵制、行动的代价、不行动同样可能失去珍贵之物连成继续前进的理由，也保留了害怕尚未消失而行动已经开始的核心弧线。keep：C4保留了行动不能消除牵挂、旧愿能够安慰却不能单独护住珍惜之物、两者难以无损并存、代价之痛和带怕行动等内容；C2明确写出不必先无惧，C1更清楚写出两种价值的冲突，C5保留了自责与不再等待无惧的转变，C3则缺少恐惧和自责这两条重要内容。cover：C4以不争取也护不住珍惜之物解释了前进为何必要，C2写出了硬撑的压力和不必先无惧的转变，C3的不能一直搁置最能解释推进感逐渐变得不可回避但没有写出恐惧仍在，C5和C1虽然保留了害怕，却较少交代为何此刻非行动不可。lean：C5的自责、两种不舍、代价和带怕行动衔接得最紧，C3的因果链也较顺但不能一直搁置与决定先做略有重叠，C2重复了两边难以兼顾的判断，C4重复了行动带来的力量和两边可能受损的判断，C1则连续几步都在重说两边难以兼顾。plain：C5的又想怪自己和再逼自己也没用最像具体的内心独白，C3的亲身试过和真去做有较强的生活触感，C1的总怪自己较自然但真正难的是带有总结口吻，C2的难处不在自己不够坚定更像分析结论，C4则最像把心理过程整理成了一套道理。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "aa067492-509f-40a6-ae09-431e4173ece7", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T220412127261Z", "elapsed_seconds": 251.703, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T22:08:23.848723+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a4bf04585db00527fbb3f648af025f1fba5668dfc44434974aa0e354d90c434a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T220412127261Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "cf70819d986299d2873b1934253a937ae550709e44eb5bc74ea0a473a8618e9d"}}}
